        aiQuizCtaTitle: "Ready to experience the future of trivia games?",
        aiQuizCtaDesc: "Try AI-driven quizzes for live, solo, or turn-based play. Create your first quiz in less than 30 seconds.",
        aiQuizCtaButton: "Start Live Game",
        aiQuizCtaButton2: "See Comparison with Kahoot",
        aiQuizIntroTitle: "What Makes AI Quiz Different?",
        aiQuizIntroDesc1: "Traditional quiz platforms require hours of manual work to create questions. You need to research topics, write questions, create multiple choice answers, and verify accuracy. With AI, this entire process happens in seconds.",
        aiQuizIntroDesc2: "Kunskapa uses Google Gemini AI to automatically generate unique, accurate questions based on any topic you choose. Whether you want to quiz about Star Wars, Swedish history, quantum physics, or 90s pop culture - AI creates the questions instantly.",
        aiQuizIntroDesc3: "But AI quiz isn't just about speed. It's about creating a more inclusive, fair, and engaging experience where different types of intelligence can shine - from knowledge and logic to mental math and pattern recognition.",
        aiQuizExamplesTitle: "Real Examples: From Idea to Quiz in Seconds",
        aiQuizExample1Title: "Star Wars + Pattern Recognition",
        aiQuizExample1Desc: "Want a quiz about Star Wars but with pattern recognition questions? Type 'Star Wars' as your topic, select 'Pattern Recognition' as question type, and AI generates unique pattern-based questions about the Star Wars universe in seconds.",
        aiQuizExample2Title: "Swedish History + Logic",
        aiQuizExample2Desc: "Teaching Swedish history but want to challenge students with logic puzzles? AI creates questions that combine historical facts with logical reasoning - making learning more engaging and memorable.",
        aiQuizExample3Title: "Custom Niche Topics",
        aiQuizExample3Desc: "Have a very specific interest like 'Vulcans in Star Trek' or '80s cartoon villains'? Traditional quiz platforms don't have these topics. With AI, you can create quizzes about literally anything - and get unique questions every time.",
        aiQuizTechnicalTitle: "How Google Gemini AI Powers Kunskapa",
        aiQuizTechnicalDesc1: "Kunskapa uses Google Gemini 2.5 Flash-Lite, a state-of-the-art AI model specifically designed for fast, efficient question generation. The AI understands context, cultural nuances, and educational requirements.",
        aiQuizTechnicalDesc2: "When you select a topic, the AI analyzes it and generates questions that are:",
        aiQuizTechnicalPoint1: "Accurate and fact-checked",
        aiQuizTechnicalPoint2: "Appropriate for the selected difficulty level",
        aiQuizTechnicalPoint3: "Relevant to the topic and context",
        aiQuizTechnicalPoint4: "Adapted to the question type (Knowledge, Logic, Mental Math, or Pattern)",
        aiQuizTechnicalDesc3: "The AI also considers language preferences, ensuring questions are natural and culturally relevant whether you're playing in Swedish or English.",
        aiQuizTechnicalDesc4: "All of this happens in the background while you're setting up your game, so questions are ready the moment you want to start playing.",
        aiQuizComparisonIntro: "Here's how AI-powered quizzes compare to traditional manual quiz creation:",
        aiQuizComparisonOutro: "The difference is clear: AI quiz platforms like Kunskapa make trivia games accessible, fast, and infinitely customizable - while traditional methods require significant time and effort.",
        aiQuizFAQTitle: "Frequently Asked Questions About AI Quiz",
        aiQuizFAQ1Question: "How accurate are AI-generated questions?",
        aiQuizFAQ1Answer: "Google Gemini AI is trained on vast amounts of verified information and is designed to generate accurate, fact-based questions. However, we always recommend verifying critical information for educational or professional use.",
        aiQuizFAQ2Question: "Can AI create questions about any topic?",
        aiQuizFAQ2Answer: "Yes! That's one of the biggest advantages of AI quiz. You can create questions about virtually any topic - from mainstream subjects like history and science to niche interests like specific TV shows, games, or hobbies.",
        aiQuizFAQ3Question: "How fast does AI generate questions?",
        aiQuizFAQ3Answer: "Typically, AI generates a complete set of questions (5 questions) in 5-15 seconds. The process happens in the background while you're setting up your game, so you can start playing almost immediately.",
        aiQuizFAQ4Question: "Are the questions always different?",
        aiQuizFAQ4Answer: "Yes! AI generates unique questions each time, even for the same topic. This means you can play multiple games about the same subject without seeing repetitive questions.",
        aiQuizFAQ5Question: "Can I use AI quiz for educational purposes?",
        aiQuizFAQ5Answer: "Absolutely! Many teachers use Kunskapa for classroom activities, homework, and review sessions. The AI is instructed to create questions relevant to Swedish educational contexts, though you should always review questions for your specific curriculum needs.",
        aiQuizFAQ6Question: "What languages does the AI support?",
        aiQuizFAQ6Answer: "Currently, Kunskapa's AI generates questions in Swedish and English. The AI understands context in both languages and creates culturally relevant questions for each.",
