        aboutTitle: "How to Play",
        aboutDescription: "Discover AI-driven quizzes for live, solo, and turn-based play. Choose category and difficulty – our AI generates questions in seconds for you and your group.",
        aboutHowItWorks: "How Kunskapa Works – No Preparation Needed!",
        aboutStep1Title: "Choose category and difficulty",
