        differentCategories: "Different categories",
        differentCategoriesDesc: "From science and history to sports and entertainment. AI-generated questions that suit all interests.",
        automaticDifficulty: "Automatic difficulty",
        automaticDifficultyDesc: "Choose between easy, medium or hard difficulty. AI adapts questions for optimal challenge.",
        whyChooseKunskapa: "Why choose Kunskapa for your next quiz experience?",
        uniqueAiTechnology: "Unique AI technology",
        uniqueAiTechnologyDesc: "Kunskapa is the only platform where you don't need to write a single question. Our AI understands your wishes and creates perfect trivia questions automatically – something no other quiz app can offer.",
        instantGameplay: "Instant gameplay experience",
        instantGameplayDesc: "No hours of preparation or complicated settings. Choose topic, difficulty and play directly. Perfect for spontaneous quiz evenings with friends or team building at work.",
        funForEveryone: "Fun for everyone",
        funForEveryoneDesc: "From children to adults, beginners to experts – AI-generated questions automatically adapt to provide the right level of challenge for all players. No one feels left out or overwhelmed.",
        faqTitle: "Frequently asked questions about AI quiz games",
        faq1Question: "How do AI-generated quiz questions work?",
        faq1Answer: "Our advanced AI analyzes your chosen category and difficulty level, then generates relevant, unique questions on the fly. Whether you choose History, D&D Monsters, or your favorite TV show, the AI creates fresh questions in seconds. You can literally quiz on anything—no preparation needed!",
        faq2Question: "Can I play AI quiz games on my phone?",
        faq2Answer: "Absolutely! Kunskapa is fully mobile-optimized and works perfectly on smartphones and tablets. Responsive design ensures you get the best gaming experience whether you're on an iPhone, Android phone, or tablet.",
        faq3Question: "Do I need to download an app or register?",
        faq3Answer: "No! Kunskapa works directly in your browser without downloads or registrations. Just create a room, share the code with friends, and start playing. Perfect for spontaneous quiz nights with family, friends, or colleagues.",
        faq4Question: "What categories can I quiz about?",
        faq4Answer: "Literally anything! The AI understands all topics: Science, History, Sports, Movies, Music, Literature, Geography, D&D monsters, K-pop, vintage video games, or your favorite book series. You can even create custom quizzes about niche topics like 'Star Wars Expanded Universe' or 'Pokemon Types'. The AI learns and adapts to your interests.",
        faq5Question: "How is this different from Kahoot or other quiz games?",
        faq5Answer: "Kunskapa uses AI to generate completely unique questions on ANY topic—no preparation needed. Most quiz games require pre-written questions or templates. With Kunskapa, you choose your topic and difficulty, and the AI creates fresh questions instantly. Plus, it's free forever with no login required.",
        faq6Question: "Can I use this for learning or studying?",
        faq6Answer: "Yes! Teachers use Kunskapa for classroom learning, students use it for exam prep, and families use it for fun learning nights. The AI adapts questions based on difficulty level, making it perfect for elementary kids learning about dinosaurs or advanced students studying organic chemistry. It's both educational and entertaining.",
        ctaTitle: "Ready to experience AI-generated quiz games?",
        ctaDescription: "Join thousands of players who have already discovered the easiest way to perfect quiz experiences. No preparation, no complications – just fun!",
