        svenskaQuizHowToStep3Title: "Pick topics",
        svenskaQuizHowToStep3Desc: "Choose categories and difficulty - AI creates questions instantly.",
        svenskaQuizHowToStep4Title: "Play your way",
        svenskaQuizHowToStep4Desc: "Answer live, play solo, or challenge friends turn-based.",
        svenskaQuizWhyTitle: "Why choose Kunskapa for AI-powered quizzes?",
        svenskaQuizWhyDesc1: "Kunskapa is the world's first truly customizable AI quiz platform. Unlike traditional quiz sites that require preparation and manual question generation, Kunskapa uses advanced AI technology (Google Gemini) to automatically create unique, fun questions about ANY topic you want - not just pre-made categories.",
        svenskaQuizWhyDesc2: "Our AI system continuously generates new questions about ALL topics imaginable - from quantum physics to reality TV, ancient civilizations to modern technology. Choose ANY subject, combine with 4 different question types (Knowledge, Logic, Mental Math, Pattern Recognition), and set your preferred difficulty level. This flexibility simply doesn't exist anywhere else!",
        svenskaQuizWhyDesc3: "Kunskapa is completely free - no registration, no hidden fees, no limitations. Create live games for up to 20 players, play solo, or challenge friends turn-based.",
        svenskaQuizFAQTitle: "Frequently Asked Questions About AI Quiz Topics",
        svenskaQuizFAQ1Question: "Can I really choose ANY topic?",
        svenskaQuizFAQ1Answer: "Yes! Kunskapa's AI can generate questions about literally any topic you can think of. From obscure scientific fields to your favorite TV shows, from historical events to modern trends - if you can name it, our AI can create quiz questions about it. This unlimited topic flexibility is what makes Kunskapa truly unique.",
        svenskaQuizFAQ2Question: "How does Kunskapa work?",
        svenskaQuizFAQ2Answer: "Kunskapa is super easy! Start a live game, get a room code, share it, choose topics, and AI creates questions automatically. You can also play solo or turn-based.",
        svenskaQuizFAQ3Question: "Do I need to register to use Kunskapa?",
        svenskaQuizFAQ3Answer: "No! Kunskapa is completely free and requires no registration at all. Create games and play directly from your phone or computer - no account needed.",
        svenskaQuizFAQ4Question: "Can I play with friends?",
        svenskaQuizFAQ4Answer: "Absolutely! Kunskapa supports live multiplayer for up to 20 players. Share a room code or create a turn-based game to play over time.",
        svenskaQuizFAQ5Question: "Does Kunskapa work on mobile?",
        svenskaQuizFAQ5Answer: "Yes! Kunskapa is fully optimized for mobile and works perfectly on all phones and tablets. Players can easily join via QR code and play directly from their mobiles - no download needed.",
        svenskaQuizFAQ6Question: "What makes Kunskapa different from other quiz platforms?",
        svenskaQuizFAQ6Answer: "Kunskapa offers unlimited topic flexibility combined with 4 question types: Knowledge (general knowledge), Logic (puzzles), Mental Math (mathematics) and Pattern Recognition. You can choose ANY topic imaginable and combine it with any question type and difficulty level. This level of customization doesn't exist on any other platform!",
        svenskaQuizFAQ7Question: "Is Kunskapa really free?",
        svenskaQuizFAQ7Answer: "Yes, 100% free! No hidden fees, no premium features to unlock. All features - AI questions, multiplayer, all question types - are completely free for all users.",
        svenskaQuizCTATitle: "Ready to create your first AI quiz?",
        svenskaQuizCTADesc: "Join thousands of users worldwide who are already using Kunskapa to create quizzes on topics they can't find anywhere else!",
