            updatesIntro: "We may update this privacy policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or legal requirements.",
            updatesNotification: "We will notify users of significant changes by posting a notice on our website. Continued use of Kunskapa after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.",
            content: "PRIVACY POLICY - KUNSKAPA\n\nLast Updated: [Current Date]\n\nINTRODUCTION\n\nWelcome to Kunskapa! We are committed to protecting your privacy and being transparent about our data practices. This privacy policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you use our services.\n\nKunskapa complies with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), the Swedish Data Protection Act (Dataskyddslagen), and other applicable privacy laws.\n\nWHAT DATA WE COLLECT\n\nKunskapa collects minimal data necessary to provide our services:\n• Game participation data (player names, scores, selected topics)\n• Technical data (browser type, device information, IP address)\n• Usage data (pages visited, time spent, interactions)\n• Locally stored preferences (player name, language preference)\n\nLegal basis: Your consent and our legitimate interest in providing and improving our services.\n\nADVERTISING AND COOKIES\n\nWe use Google AdSense to serve ads. Google, as a third-party vendor, uses cookies to serve ads on our site. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to our users based on their visit to our sites and/or other sites on the Internet. Users may opt-out of personalized advertising by visiting Ads Settings or www.aboutads.info.\n\nGoogle may collect and use data for ad personalization. Third-party advertising partners may use cookies and similar technologies. Ad targeting is based on your browsing behavior and interests. You can control ad personalization through Google's Ad Settings or by managing your cookie consent preferences on our site.\n\nFor more information, please view Google's Privacy Policy at https://policies.google.com/privacy.\n\nGOOGLE ANALYTICS\n\nWe use Google Analytics 4 to understand how visitors use our site and improve your experience:\n• Page views and user interactions are tracked anonymously\n• IP addresses are anonymized to protect your identity\n• Data is retained for 14 months and then automatically deleted\n• No personally identifiable information (PII) is collected\n\nCOOKIES & LOCAL STORAGE\n\nKunskapa uses cookies and browser local storage to enhance your experience:\n\nEssential Storage:\n• Player name and preferences (localStorage)\n• Game session data and reconnection tokens\n\nAnalytics Cookies:\n• Google Analytics tracking cookies (_ga, _gid)\n• Usage statistics and performance monitoring\n\nAdvertising Cookies:\n• Google AdSense cookies for ad delivery\n• Ad personalization and measurement cookies\n\nYou can control cookies through your browser settings. Note that blocking essential cookies may affect game functionality.\n\nYOUR RIGHTS UNDER GDPR\n\nUnder GDPR, you have the following rights regarding your personal data:\n\nRight to Access: Request a copy of the personal data we hold about you\nRight to Rectification: Request correction of inaccurate or incomplete data\nRight to Erasure: Request deletion of your personal data (\"right to be forgotten\")\nRight to Data Portability: Receive your data in a structured, commonly used format\nRight to Object: Object to processing of your personal data for certain purposes\nRight to Withdraw Consent: Withdraw your consent at any time without affecting prior processing\n\nDATA SECURITY\n\nWe implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your data:\n• SSL/TLS encryption for all data transmission\n• Secure cloud infrastructure (Supabase with EU hosting)\n• Regular security audits and updates\n• Access controls and data minimization practices\n\nCONTACT US\n\nIf you have any questions about this privacy policy or wish to exercise your rights, please contact us:\n\nEmail: fredrik.carleson@gmail.com\n\nWe will respond to all requests within 30 days as required by GDPR.\n\nPOLICY UPDATES\n\nWe may update this privacy policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or legal requirements. We will notify users of significant changes by posting a notice on our website. Continued use of Kunskapa after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.\n\nVersion: 1.0\nEffective Date: [Current Date]"
