        installAppPWATitle: "What is a Progressive Web App (PWA)?",
        installAppPWADesc1: "A Progressive Web App (PWA) is a website that works like a native mobile app. You can install it on your phone or tablet without visiting an app store, and it provides an app-like experience with features like offline access and automatic updates.",
        installAppPWADesc2: "Kunskapa is built as a PWA, which means you get all the benefits of a mobile app without the hassle of downloading from the App Store or Google Play.",
        installAppPWADesc3: "Once installed, Kunskapa appears on your home screen just like any other app, opens in full-screen mode, and can work offline for certain features.",
        installAppBenefitsTitle: "Benefits of Installing Kunskapa",
        installAppBenefit1Title: "Quick Access",
        installAppBenefit1Desc: "Launch Kunskapa directly from your home screen with a single tap. No need to open a browser and type in the URL every time you want to play.",
        installAppBenefit2Title: "App-like Experience",
        installAppBenefit2Desc: "Enjoy a full-screen experience without browser bars, making it feel like a native app. The interface is optimized for mobile use.",
        installAppBenefit3Title: "No Download Required",
        installAppBenefit3Desc: "Takes minimal storage space (just a few MB for cached data) and doesn't require an App Store account or payment. Perfect for devices with limited storage.",
        installAppBenefit4Title: "Offline Capabilities",
        installAppBenefit4Desc: "Some features work offline. You can view previously loaded content and continue playing solo games even without an internet connection.",
        installAppBenefit5Title: "Automatic Updates",
        installAppBenefit5Desc: "Kunskapa updates automatically in the background. You always get the latest features and improvements without manually updating.",
        installAppBenefit6Title: "Home Screen Shortcuts",
        installAppBenefit6Desc: "Quick access to common actions like creating a new quiz or browsing Swedish quiz topics directly from your home screen.",
        installAppTechFeaturesTitle: "Technical Features",
        installAppTechFeature1Title: "Offline Mode",
        installAppTechFeature1Desc: "Kunskapa uses service workers to cache content, allowing you to access previously loaded pages and play solo games even when offline. Data syncs automatically when you're back online.",
        installAppTechFeature2Title: "Auto-Updates",
        installAppTechFeature2Desc: "The app checks for updates automatically and installs them in the background. You'll always have the latest version with new features and bug fixes.",
        installAppTechFeature3Title: "Home Screen Shortcuts",
        installAppTechFeature3Desc: "Long-press the Kunskapa icon on your home screen to access quick actions like 'Create Quiz' or 'Swedish Quiz' for faster navigation.",
        installAppTroubleshootingTitle: "Troubleshooting",
        installAppTroubleshootingIntro: "Having trouble installing? Here are solutions to common issues:",
        installAppTrouble1Question: "I don't see 'Add to Home Screen' option",
        installAppTrouble1Answer: "Make sure you're using Safari on iOS (not Chrome) or Chrome on Android. The option may also be hidden in the menu - try scrolling down in the share menu.",
        installAppTrouble2Question: "The app doesn't work offline",
        installAppTrouble2Answer: "Offline mode requires that you've visited the pages while online first. Make sure you've loaded the pages you want to use offline at least once with an internet connection.",
        installAppTrouble3Question: "I can't find the app after installing",
        installAppTrouble3Answer: "Check your home screen - the Kunskapa icon should appear there. On iOS, it may be on a secondary home screen. On Android, check your app drawer.",
        installAppTrouble4Question: "The app looks different after installing",
        installAppTrouble4Answer: "This is normal! The app runs in standalone mode (full-screen) when installed, which removes browser bars. This is the intended behavior for a better app-like experience.",
        installAppFAQTitle: "Frequently Asked Questions",
        installAppFAQ1Question: "Do I need to install the app to use Kunskapa?",
        installAppFAQ1Answer: "No! You can use Kunskapa directly in your browser without installing. However, installing it gives you faster access and additional features like offline mode.",
        installAppFAQ2Question: "Will installing the app use a lot of storage?",
        installAppFAQ2Answer: "No, PWAs use minimal storage (typically less than 5MB). Most content is cached temporarily and can be cleared if needed.",
        installAppFAQ3Question: "Do I need to update the app manually?",
        installAppFAQ3Answer: "No, Kunskapa updates automatically in the background. You'll always have the latest version without any action required.",
        installAppFAQ4Question: "Can I uninstall the app?",
        installAppFAQ4Answer: "Yes! Simply delete the icon from your home screen like you would any other app. This won't affect your ability to use Kunskapa in a browser.",
        installAppFAQ5Question: "Will notifications work?",
        installAppFAQ5Answer: "Kunskapa can send push notifications for important updates, but you'll need to grant permission when prompted. You can manage notifications in your device settings.",
        installAppFAQ6Question: "Does it work on tablets?",
        installAppFAQ6Answer: "Yes! Kunskapa works great on both phones and tablets. The installation process is the same for both iOS and Android tablets.",
        installAppAfterTitle: "After Installation",
        installAppAfterDesc1: "Once you've installed Kunskapa, you'll notice it opens in full-screen mode without browser bars, giving you a native app experience.",
        installAppAfterDesc2: "Try long-pressing the Kunskapa icon on your home screen to see quick shortcuts like 'Create Quiz' or 'Swedish Quiz' for even faster access.",
        installAppAfterDesc3: "The app will automatically update in the background, so you'll always have the latest features. No need to manually check for updates!",
        installAppAfterDesc4: "If you're offline, you can still access previously loaded pages and play solo games. Your progress will sync when you're back online.",
        installAppComparisonTitle: "PWA vs Traditional App",
        installAppComparisonIntro: "Why choose a PWA over a traditional app from the App Store?",
